WEBVTT

00:00:01.630 --> 00:00:03.530
<i>Next up is Book Corner.</i>

00:00:03.530 --> 00:00:05.480
<i>The book we're previewing today is:</i>

00:00:05.480 --> 00:00:09.060
<i>"This is the Tale of a Little Sister Who 
Loves Her Brother Too Much to Cope."</i>

00:00:09.060 --> 00:00:10.780
Oh, it's starting!

00:00:10.780 --> 00:00:12.740
<b>Feature</b>

00:00:10.780 --> 00:00:12.740
A New Wave is Coming

00:00:10.780 --> 00:00:12.740
<b>A Miraculous New Author! This masterpiece by Towano 
Chikai makes all other little sister stories look outdated</b>

00:00:10.780 --> 00:00:12.740
Sumeragi Fantasy 
First Prize Winner

00:00:10.780 --> 00:00:14.610
<i>The winner of the 2018 Sumeragi 
Fantasy New Author Contest...</i>

00:00:13.200 --> 00:00:15.800
Onii-chan, your table manners are terrible.

00:00:15.800 --> 00:00:17.580
O-Oh, right. Sorry.

00:00:18.520 --> 00:00:22.030
Still, it's really something that 
they're talking about it on TV, Suzuka!

00:00:22.030 --> 00:00:24.330
Oh, thank you very much.

00:00:24.580 --> 00:00:27.590
By the way, have you thought about 
what you're going to do in volume two?

00:00:28.270 --> 00:00:31.550
Yes. I've been discussing it 
with Shinozaki-san over email.

00:00:31.810 --> 00:00:32.980
I see.

00:00:32.980 --> 00:00:35.760
Let me know if there's anything I can do.

00:00:36.480 --> 00:00:39.010
I'm counting on you, Onii-chan.

00:02:09.900 --> 00:02:14.940
Episode 2: My Little Sister Aims for the Greatest Heights

00:02:15.710 --> 00:02:17.070
School's out, finally.

00:02:17.530 --> 00:02:21.400
I hardly slept last night 'cause I was writing 
stuff for the next new author contest.

00:02:21.400 --> 00:02:23.420
I'll grab a little shut-eye before work.

00:02:31.270 --> 00:02:32.560
Hm?

00:02:36.280 --> 00:02:38.260
So you finally decided to wake up...

00:02:38.520 --> 00:02:39.260
Huh?

00:02:39.960 --> 00:02:42.360
H-Himuro... Mai?!

00:02:42.360 --> 00:02:45.640
Why, thank you for remembering my full name.

00:02:46.200 --> 00:02:48.420
H-Himuro-san's speaking to a <i>guy?!</i>

00:02:48.420 --> 00:02:50.560
And why Nagami of all people?!

00:02:50.560 --> 00:02:51.340
I-I'm so jealous.

00:02:51.340 --> 00:02:53.840
Wh-What do you want with me?

00:02:53.840 --> 00:02:55.070
We need to talk.

00:02:55.540 --> 00:02:56.930
Come with me for a bit.

00:02:56.930 --> 00:02:59.820
Wh-Who, me? Talk to you?!

00:03:00.240 --> 00:03:01.790
That's what I said, isn't it?

00:03:01.790 --> 00:03:03.240
Don't make me repeat myself.

00:03:03.840 --> 00:03:06.830
It's not something we can discuss here,
 so let's go somewhere else.

00:03:07.520 --> 00:03:08.710
Come with me.

00:03:16.800 --> 00:03:18.340
Ack! Th-That's...

00:03:18.570 --> 00:03:21.540
Well, duh. You're <i>bound</i> to 
recognize it. Isn't that right...

00:03:21.540 --> 00:03:23.010
...Towano Chikai-sensei?

00:03:23.010 --> 00:03:25.300
Wh-What are you talking about?

00:03:26.100 --> 00:03:27.840
You can't fool me.

00:03:27.840 --> 00:03:30.580
I was at the awards ceremony,

00:03:30.580 --> 00:03:33.600
so I know that you're Towano Chikai.

00:03:34.260 --> 00:03:36.080
You were there, too?

00:03:36.080 --> 00:03:38.280
But didn't only people in 
the industry go to that?

00:03:39.620 --> 00:03:41.270
Yes! I'm actually—

00:03:41.270 --> 00:03:43.200
You're a voice actress?!

00:03:43.200 --> 00:03:44.910
N-No, I'm not!

00:03:44.910 --> 00:03:46.780
True, I did voice acting for a time, but...

00:03:47.460 --> 00:03:51.260
Why did you jump to that conclusion instead 
of thinking I was a fellow light novel author?

00:03:51.260 --> 00:03:53.170
Y-You're a light novel author?

00:03:53.170 --> 00:03:55.500
What's with that "I don't 
believe you" look on your face,

00:03:55.500 --> 00:03:57.920
when before you stands a popular author?

00:03:58.160 --> 00:03:59.630
You're a popular author?

00:03:59.630 --> 00:04:01.920
And what series do you write, hm?

00:04:02.250 --> 00:04:05.930
At the moment, I'm writing "Sky Magic Guardian."

00:04:06.420 --> 00:04:08.000
Hold up! Wait, wait, wait, wait!

00:04:08.000 --> 00:04:09.400
Did you just say "Sky MaGa"?!

00:04:09.400 --> 00:04:11.810
If you're writing Sky MaGa,
 that means you're...

00:04:12.020 --> 00:04:17.820
Yes, I'm the up-and-coming author 
who's making waves, Enryuu Homura!

00:04:19.440 --> 00:04:20.310
I'm a massive fan!

00:04:20.310 --> 00:04:21.320
Can I have your autograph?!

00:04:21.720 --> 00:04:25.170
Y-You're a fan? A fan of my...

00:04:25.170 --> 00:04:27.410
Th-This is humiliating.

00:04:28.440 --> 00:04:29.950
H-Humiliating?

00:04:30.430 --> 00:04:33.160
<i>I'm</i> the one who wants <i>your</i> autograph!

00:04:33.420 --> 00:04:37.130
What do you mean, you want my autograph?

00:04:37.560 --> 00:04:39.360
Are you still asleep?!

00:04:39.360 --> 00:04:41.630
I want your autograph!

00:04:42.190 --> 00:04:44.130
Y-You want my autograph? But why?

00:04:44.570 --> 00:04:46.680
Isn't that obvious?

00:04:46.680 --> 00:04:49.640
Because I'm a huge fan 
of yours, Towano-sensei.

00:04:50.250 --> 00:04:51.560
Huh...

00:04:52.020 --> 00:04:54.640
I-I'd like your autograph right now.

00:04:55.390 --> 00:05:00.610
Put: "To my first fan" at the top, 
and "Himuro Mai-san" at the bottom, okay?

00:05:01.160 --> 00:05:05.490
Wh-Why is an author as popular as you 
a fan of someone else's work?

00:05:05.490 --> 00:05:06.960
That's a silly question.

00:05:06.960 --> 00:05:09.500
Why <i>shouldn't</i> a popular author 
be a fan of other authors?

00:05:09.500 --> 00:05:14.120
Besides, if you think <i>I'm</i> popular, then
you're pretty much a superstar, you know?

00:05:14.550 --> 00:05:18.370
<i>I guess she has a point, 
but this still doesn't feel real.</i>

00:05:18.370 --> 00:05:20.130
Okay, listen closely.

00:05:20.530 --> 00:05:24.000
Writing light novels is 
incredibly important to me.

00:05:24.000 --> 00:05:27.640
That's why I work so hard on them, and 
how I've gained the popularity I have.

00:05:27.640 --> 00:05:32.810
But then, one day, I met an author who
shattered my pride and reduced it to dust.

00:05:32.810 --> 00:05:35.390
You were that author, Towano Chikai.

00:05:35.740 --> 00:05:40.220
Originally, I read your story 
because it won the award,

00:05:40.220 --> 00:05:41.860
but it left me in shock.

00:05:42.280 --> 00:05:45.730
It is undoubtedly the work of a genius.

00:05:45.730 --> 00:05:46.740
Right?!

00:05:48.620 --> 00:05:50.820
So you know you're a genius, huh?

00:05:50.820 --> 00:05:53.870
Well, I guess that's only natural 
after writing something that good.

00:05:56.250 --> 00:05:58.990
At first, I was so jealous 
I was planning to murder you,

00:05:58.990 --> 00:06:00.750
and kill myself afterward.

00:06:01.390 --> 00:06:03.130
That's pretty scary...

00:06:03.710 --> 00:06:08.520
But your work was so entertaining, 
it blew away all of my jealousy.

00:06:08.520 --> 00:06:12.390
Before I knew it, I'd bought more than 50 copies 
of your book, and I was fangirling hard.

00:06:12.390 --> 00:06:14.610
That's way too many copies of one book!

00:06:14.610 --> 00:06:16.330
It's a perfectly normal amount.

00:06:17.320 --> 00:06:20.040
Because I've decided to study
 everything about you,

00:06:20.040 --> 00:06:22.770
so I can emulate its entertaining style!

00:06:23.340 --> 00:06:25.530
Y-You're scaring me...

00:06:25.800 --> 00:06:30.250
I've read it enough times to memorize it, 
but I realized that wasn't enough.

00:06:30.250 --> 00:06:32.700
In order to understand what 
makes your work so entertaining,

00:06:32.700 --> 00:06:35.280
I have to study the author, too.

00:06:35.720 --> 00:06:37.700
Y-You don't mean...

00:06:38.000 --> 00:06:38.710
I do!

00:06:38.950 --> 00:06:42.960
I'm going to dig up everything on
your private life and study you in depth!

00:06:43.320 --> 00:06:44.920
Sounds stalkerish...

00:06:45.680 --> 00:06:47.400
S-Stalkerish?!

00:06:47.400 --> 00:06:49.430
It's nothing like that!

00:06:49.750 --> 00:06:51.510
What you're telling me isn't any—

00:06:51.510 --> 00:06:52.540
Anyway!

00:06:52.540 --> 00:06:54.190
I'm not taking no for an answer!

00:06:54.190 --> 00:06:55.270
If you say no,

00:06:55.270 --> 00:06:58.600
I'll reveal your identity as Towano 
Chikai over the school's PA system,

00:06:58.880 --> 00:07:00.920
and praise your work!

00:07:00.920 --> 00:07:02.730
What the heck?!

00:07:03.760 --> 00:07:07.730
So, Towano-sensei, you're coming 
with me for an interview at once!

00:07:08.640 --> 00:07:10.150
R-Right now?!

00:07:13.530 --> 00:07:16.350
Uh, hey... you sure you want 
to come over my house?

00:07:16.350 --> 00:07:18.100
What are you talking about, Yuu?

00:07:18.100 --> 00:07:19.960
You said you'd cooperate with me, didn't you?

00:07:20.470 --> 00:07:23.330
Wait, why are you calling me by my first name?

00:07:23.840 --> 00:07:26.610
Would you rather I called you Towano-sensei?

00:07:26.610 --> 00:07:28.730
You could just use Nagami!

00:07:28.730 --> 00:07:30.260
I'll call you Himuro, too.

00:07:30.920 --> 00:07:33.110
I hate being addressed by my last name.

00:07:33.110 --> 00:07:36.180
And I hate being the only one 
addressed by my first name, too.

00:07:40.230 --> 00:07:43.120
Your eyes were on me 
the whole time I was at work.

00:07:43.120 --> 00:07:44.720
It sure was annoying.

00:07:48.160 --> 00:07:50.400
Hey! What are you jotting down?!

00:07:50.650 --> 00:07:50.780
<b>Nagami Yuu 
Research Notebook</b>

00:07:50.780 --> 00:07:50.900
<b>Nagami Yuu 
Research Notebook</b>

00:07:50.900 --> 00:07:51.030
<b>Nagami Yuu 
Research Notebook</b>

00:07:51.030 --> 00:07:51.150
<b>Nagami Yuu 
Research Notebook</b>

00:07:51.150 --> 00:07:51.280
<b>Nagami Yuu 
Research Notebook</b>

00:07:51.280 --> 00:07:51.400
<b>Nagami Yuu 
Research Notebook</b>

00:07:51.400 --> 00:07:51.530
<b>Nagami Yuu 
Research Notebook</b>

00:07:51.500 --> 00:07:53.080
Details about your home.

00:07:51.530 --> 00:07:52.820
<b>Nagami Yuu 
Research Notebook</b>

00:07:53.590 --> 00:07:57.280
Don't worry. I'm not trying 
to figure out how to sneak in.

00:07:57.990 --> 00:08:00.800
I don't trust you one bit!

00:08:00.800 --> 00:08:03.040
Welcome home, Onii-chan.

00:08:03.520 --> 00:08:06.300
What on earth is all this 
commotion at the front door?

00:08:07.720 --> 00:08:09.250
And who's this, Onii-chan?

00:08:09.760 --> 00:08:12.840
Oh, this is my classmate, Himuro.

00:08:12.840 --> 00:08:14.910
Mai, this is my little sister, Suzuka.

00:08:14.910 --> 00:08:16.480
Oh, nice to meet you.

00:08:16.480 --> 00:08:18.720
Wait, Yuu... You have a little sister?

00:08:19.260 --> 00:08:22.840
Huh? Oh, I-I'm Nagami Suzuka.

00:08:22.840 --> 00:08:23.800
Huh?

00:08:23.800 --> 00:08:25.890
Mai? Yuu?

00:08:28.730 --> 00:08:32.160
H-Huh. So this is your room, huh?

00:08:32.670 --> 00:08:34.540
Pretty normal, wouldn't you say?

00:08:34.540 --> 00:08:37.200
There's nothing special about a guy's room.

00:08:37.580 --> 00:08:39.630
M-Maybe to <i>you</i>,

00:08:39.630 --> 00:08:43.610
but I've never been in a guy's 
room before, so I wouldn't know.

00:08:43.610 --> 00:08:45.120
Really?

00:08:45.120 --> 00:08:47.040
Wait, what are you taking pictures for?!

00:08:47.470 --> 00:08:49.250
No photographs!

00:08:49.470 --> 00:08:51.020
Well, if you insist.

00:08:51.020 --> 00:08:53.260
In that case, I'll have to burn 
the image into my retinas.

00:08:53.260 --> 00:08:54.130
Let's see...

00:08:53.760 --> 00:08:56.610
Th-They sound like they're really close.

00:08:54.130 --> 00:08:56.610
Hey, don't do that!

00:08:56.610 --> 00:08:57.120
You'll open it!

00:08:57.120 --> 00:08:57.850
Can I open it?

00:08:57.850 --> 00:08:58.280
No, no, no!

00:08:58.280 --> 00:08:59.530
Hey, let me open it!

00:08:59.530 --> 00:09:00.050
You can't!

00:09:00.050 --> 00:09:00.920
Why not?

00:09:02.520 --> 00:09:03.560
Stop it already!

00:09:05.390 --> 00:09:06.670
Uh, excuse me...

00:09:07.800 --> 00:09:09.520
Oh, don't mind me.

00:09:10.950 --> 00:09:13.310
Ah, thanks, Suzuka.

00:09:14.630 --> 00:09:17.480
Huh? Suzuka, you're not 
going back to your room?

00:09:17.480 --> 00:09:21.740
No. I can't leave you alone 
with another woman.

00:09:22.050 --> 00:09:23.760
Huh? What did you say?

00:09:23.760 --> 00:09:26.080
Yuu, don't tell me you're...

00:09:26.470 --> 00:09:28.540
Onii-chan's an animal.

00:09:29.120 --> 00:09:31.000
Hey! S-Suzuka!

00:09:31.000 --> 00:09:32.600
R-Right.

00:09:32.600 --> 00:09:37.590
You'd <i>have</i> to be a horny demon 
to write such intense scenes.

00:09:37.590 --> 00:09:38.970
M-Mai?

00:09:39.260 --> 00:09:40.970
A-All right.

00:09:40.970 --> 00:09:42.640
This is for my light novels.

00:09:43.530 --> 00:09:45.680
You can have your way with me, Yuu.

00:09:45.950 --> 00:09:47.540
How is that all right?!

00:09:48.200 --> 00:09:50.250
Onii-chan, should I call the police?

00:09:51.900 --> 00:09:54.360
Today's the day I finally become a woman...

00:09:54.360 --> 00:09:57.780
If only I'd known... 
I would've worn cuter panties.

00:09:58.090 --> 00:10:00.250
Mai-san, what are you saying?!

00:10:01.730 --> 00:10:03.400
Hello? Officer?

00:10:03.400 --> 00:10:04.720
A sex offender has broken into—

00:10:04.720 --> 00:10:06.180
Suzuka-san?!

00:10:06.180 --> 00:10:08.540
Don't report your brother!

00:10:09.600 --> 00:10:12.650
"Then, Nagami Yuu forced me down,
 despite my resistance, and said:

00:10:12.650 --> 00:10:14.300
'It's no use screaming.'"

00:10:14.750 --> 00:10:17.400
"'No one's gonna come and 
rescue you. Heh, heh, heh!'

00:10:17.400 --> 00:10:20.870
he laughed, squeezing my breasts 
with his lecherous hands—"

00:10:20.870 --> 00:10:23.350
Hey! Stop fabricating notes!

00:10:23.350 --> 00:10:26.600
Onii-chan... No, Nagami Yuu-san...

00:10:26.880 --> 00:10:28.320
You changed it?!

00:10:28.320 --> 00:10:30.740
Oh! Your own sister has felt the 
touch of your amorous hands, too?!

00:10:30.740 --> 00:10:33.110
No, no, no! And what do you mean, "too"?!

00:10:33.370 --> 00:10:35.820
Yuu, is it all right if I call the police?

00:10:36.600 --> 00:10:38.090
We're going through that again?!

00:10:38.090 --> 00:10:39.060
Go home already!

00:10:39.060 --> 00:10:40.240
I'll see you out!

00:10:40.480 --> 00:10:43.200
What? But I just got here!

00:10:43.200 --> 00:10:45.660
Just do it! Or I'll blacklist you!

00:10:45.960 --> 00:10:47.640
A-All right, all right.

00:10:47.640 --> 00:10:49.410
I'll come back again tomorrow.

00:10:51.280 --> 00:10:53.420
Tomorrow, huh?

00:10:55.120 --> 00:10:57.920
Okay, Suzuka, I'll walk Mai home.

00:11:00.020 --> 00:11:01.180
Wh-What?

00:11:01.520 --> 00:11:05.680
Himuro-san, please make sure you 
don't let Onii-chan into your home.

00:11:06.120 --> 00:11:07.730
Why not?

00:11:07.730 --> 00:11:10.480
Because I don't want anyone in 
our family to become a criminal.

00:11:10.480 --> 00:11:12.620
You have zero faith in me...

00:11:19.240 --> 00:11:20.390
I'm ho—

00:11:21.920 --> 00:11:25.160
Onii-chan, you're going 
to explain everything to me.

00:11:25.740 --> 00:11:26.710
Yes, ma'am.

00:11:29.250 --> 00:11:31.640
So that's what happened.

00:11:31.640 --> 00:11:32.670
I see.

00:11:33.020 --> 00:11:35.300
I think I've got a handle on the situation now.

00:11:35.300 --> 00:11:38.260
So the Enryuu Homura-sensei 
you're such a huge fan of...

00:11:38.260 --> 00:11:42.260
...is, in fact, the incredibly 
beautiful and buxom Himuro-san.

00:11:42.570 --> 00:11:43.680
No!

00:11:43.680 --> 00:11:47.830
I said that Mai wants to find out the secret 
behind how your novel got so entertaining!

00:11:47.830 --> 00:11:50.600
Besides, she's not <i>my</i> fan. She's <i>your</i> fan!

00:11:51.830 --> 00:11:54.980
<i>Why did such a pretty woman have to show up?!</i>

00:11:54.980 --> 00:11:57.450
<i>I-If this keeps up, I should just...</i>

00:11:57.910 --> 00:12:00.860
O-Onii-chan, I have a request.

00:12:01.140 --> 00:12:02.880
A r-request?

00:12:02.880 --> 00:12:03.610
Yes.

00:12:03.990 --> 00:12:07.370
On our day off tomorrow, 
can we go on a da—

00:12:07.370 --> 00:12:10.120
Oh, I mean... Can we go out together?

00:12:10.310 --> 00:12:12.850
Huh? What do you mean?

00:12:12.850 --> 00:12:14.880
W-Well, um, uh...

00:12:15.750 --> 00:12:19.180
In volume two, there's a scene 
where the siblings go out together,

00:12:19.180 --> 00:12:20.880
so I need to gather material for it.

00:12:21.280 --> 00:12:22.800
Material? Makes sense.

00:12:22.800 --> 00:12:25.010
So it's supposed to be like, a date?

00:12:25.310 --> 00:12:27.330
I-I-I-I-I-It's not a date!

00:12:27.330 --> 00:12:29.770
We're only going out to gather material!

00:12:30.040 --> 00:12:32.500
Ah, sorry. You're right!

00:12:32.500 --> 00:12:34.520
We're siblings, so it can't be a date.

00:12:35.190 --> 00:12:38.850
A-As long as you're not 
getting the wrong idea, it's fine.

00:12:38.850 --> 00:12:41.940
Can I leave where we're going up to you?

00:12:42.480 --> 00:12:43.600
Sure.

00:12:43.600 --> 00:12:45.030
I'll figure something out.

00:12:45.030 --> 00:12:48.840
So while we're on our date—
 I mean, while we're out tomorrow,

00:12:48.840 --> 00:12:52.540
please can it just be the two of us?

00:12:52.540 --> 00:12:55.040
<b>My Sister, 
My Writer
</b>

00:12:56.250 --> 00:12:58.550
So that's when I gave him an earful.

00:12:59.120 --> 00:13:02.420
<i>I thought you called because 
you wanted to discuss volume two.</i>

00:13:02.700 --> 00:13:04.650
What are you talking about?

00:13:04.650 --> 00:13:07.430
We've discussed it plenty over email.

00:13:07.430 --> 00:13:10.100
<i>Then, why are you calling me?</i>

00:13:10.450 --> 00:13:12.080
Because I had to.

00:13:12.080 --> 00:13:16.080
You're so serious in your messages,
 it's like you're a different person.

00:13:16.860 --> 00:13:19.440
Anyway, isn't it natural for
 an editor to go out of her way

00:13:19.440 --> 00:13:21.570
to call you on her day off 
and build up some skinship?

00:13:22.540 --> 00:13:25.140
<i>I can't really argue when 
she puts it like that.</i>

00:13:25.920 --> 00:13:28.070
Where <i>exactly</i> are you calling 
me from? It's bugging me.

00:13:28.300 --> 00:13:30.690
Huh? I'm taking a bath.

00:13:30.690 --> 00:13:33.000
<i>A b-bath?</i>

00:13:33.000 --> 00:13:35.000
Oh, I get it.

00:13:35.000 --> 00:13:38.750
You're imagining me writhing 
around all wet and naked, huh?

00:13:38.750 --> 00:13:42.500
In that case, I'll help you out in my 
capacity as a professional editor.

00:13:43.170 --> 00:13:45.090
Sorry it's over the phone, though.

00:13:45.090 --> 00:13:46.640
What would you like me to do?

00:13:46.640 --> 00:13:49.310
Would some moaning quench your thirst?

00:13:50.720 --> 00:13:53.660
You're a failure as a professional editor!

00:13:56.570 --> 00:14:00.610
I was hoping to get some work
done before I headed out...

00:14:00.610 --> 00:14:03.360
Wait, is that the time already?

00:14:04.790 --> 00:14:07.000
This is rather fancy.

00:14:07.000 --> 00:14:09.440
Onii-chan's clothes are 
a bit on the plain side,

00:14:09.440 --> 00:14:12.370
so I'd look odd walking 
next to him in this.

00:14:12.370 --> 00:14:15.900
I wonder if this one isn't 
a little <i>too</i> plain, though.

00:14:20.560 --> 00:14:23.080
Yeah, this one might work!

00:14:23.080 --> 00:14:26.130
Oh, but perhaps it's a little short?

00:14:26.590 --> 00:14:28.590
Hey, Suzuka, are you there?

00:14:33.480 --> 00:14:35.290
O-Onii-chan!

00:14:35.290 --> 00:14:37.220
I'm s-s-s-s-s-s-sorry!

00:14:38.940 --> 00:14:40.480
Onii-chan...

00:14:49.840 --> 00:14:53.490
Are all the books on 
these shelves light novels?

00:14:53.760 --> 00:14:54.780
Yeah, you bet!

00:14:54.780 --> 00:15:00.220
By the way, the light novel I recommend 
is Sky Magic Guardian, AKA Sky MaGa!

00:15:00.220 --> 00:15:01.980
What makes that one so wonderful

00:15:01.980 --> 00:15:03.990
is the intense battles as 
they fly through the air—

00:15:03.990 --> 00:15:05.050
Onii-chan...

00:15:05.910 --> 00:15:07.840
You're scaring me.

00:15:07.840 --> 00:15:13.010
Sir, if you're debating which one to buy, 
would you like my recommendation?

00:15:13.480 --> 00:15:14.190
Sure.

00:15:15.730 --> 00:15:18.080
Out store is promiting a novel called

00:15:18.080 --> 00:15:22.690
"This is the Tale of a Little Sister Who 
Loves Her Brother Too Much to Cope!"

00:15:22.690 --> 00:15:24.360
My light novel?

00:15:24.360 --> 00:15:25.020
Yeah.

00:15:25.300 --> 00:15:26.280
Yes!

00:15:26.280 --> 00:15:29.680
A superlative and simply
 sublime light novel!

00:15:29.680 --> 00:15:32.530
The title marks it out 
as a flirty sibling romance,

00:15:32.780 --> 00:15:34.890
but it doesn't read like one at all!

00:15:34.890 --> 00:15:36.910
It's a tale only a genius could have written!

00:15:36.910 --> 00:15:42.000
The heroine, Yuuka, is a little sister <i>so</i> cute 
that no other little sister character

00:15:42.000 --> 00:15:45.830
in the world can measure up to her!

00:15:45.830 --> 00:15:48.680
W-Wow. You've really piqued my interest.

00:15:48.680 --> 00:15:53.560
In that case, take a chance 
on it and give it a read.

00:15:53.560 --> 00:15:55.800
Yes! I'll buy a copy this instant!

00:15:55.800 --> 00:15:57.280
This instant it is, sir!

00:15:57.280 --> 00:15:59.700
The staff are praising it to the skies.

00:16:00.260 --> 00:16:02.520
It have way more shelf space 
than other books, too.

00:16:02.520 --> 00:16:05.600
That just goes to show how 
popular your novel is.

00:16:05.600 --> 00:16:08.500
Onii-chan, is this what you wanted to show me?

00:16:12.040 --> 00:16:14.640
Right, where shall we go next?

00:16:14.640 --> 00:16:16.240
Huh? Is this...

00:16:19.160 --> 00:16:21.320
Onii-chan, is this illustration...

00:16:21.320 --> 00:16:22.000
Hm?

00:16:22.000 --> 00:16:24.520
Oh, it's by Double Peace-sensei!

00:16:24.520 --> 00:16:27.300
You know, the person who's 
illustrating your series.

00:16:28.510 --> 00:16:30.510
<i>Oh, sh-shoot!</i>

00:16:30.860 --> 00:16:32.510
<i>This store is...</i>

00:16:33.350 --> 00:16:34.820
S-Suzuka...

00:16:34.820 --> 00:16:38.920
There's nothing in that store that 
you'll find useful for your writing.

00:16:38.920 --> 00:16:41.020
That sounds suspicious.

00:16:41.020 --> 00:16:43.830
I-It doesn't at all!

00:16:43.830 --> 00:16:47.650
I can look and decide for myself 
whether or not it's useful.

00:16:52.230 --> 00:16:54.400
What will be, will be, I guess!

00:16:58.150 --> 00:17:01.620
What?! What on earth <i>is</i> this place?!

00:17:03.200 --> 00:17:05.440
As you can see, it's a shop for erotic games—

00:17:05.440 --> 00:17:07.760
I can see perfectly well what it is!

00:17:07.760 --> 00:17:11.130
I-I-I-I can't believe there 
are so many lewd drawings!

00:17:11.520 --> 00:17:14.010
If you knew it was like this, 
you should've said something!

00:17:14.010 --> 00:17:16.380
Well, I tried to stop you!

00:17:17.410 --> 00:17:20.640
I never realized you were such 
a randy beast, Onii-chan.

00:17:21.020 --> 00:17:23.680
What makes you think I am?!

00:17:23.680 --> 00:17:26.960
Well, well, if it isn't Towano-sensei!

00:17:27.880 --> 00:17:29.440
Double Peace-sensei!

00:17:29.960 --> 00:17:31.220
Don't call me that.

00:17:31.220 --> 00:17:33.720
Please call me Ahegao instead.

00:17:33.720 --> 00:17:35.670
That's the core!

00:17:35.670 --> 00:17:37.360
The core of what?!

00:17:37.360 --> 00:17:42.490
It's the ahegao part that makes 
the double peace sign so obscene!

00:17:42.800 --> 00:17:44.830
You say that, but...

00:17:44.830 --> 00:17:47.440
Onii-chan, what's an "ahegao"?

00:17:47.440 --> 00:17:50.080
Y-You're too young, Suzuka.

00:17:50.080 --> 00:17:51.860
An ahegao is...

00:17:51.860 --> 00:17:54.490
the expression a strong woman makes 
when she gives in to passion and—

00:17:54.490 --> 00:17:55.590
Don't finish that sentence!

00:18:00.280 --> 00:18:03.430
By the way, what are you doing here, Sensei?

00:18:04.200 --> 00:18:06.920
I-I'm actually gathering 
material for volume two.

00:18:06.920 --> 00:18:08.800
Oh, you are?

00:18:08.800 --> 00:18:12.650
In that case, this beautiful young 
girl must be your little sister, yes?

00:18:13.800 --> 00:18:14.930
Nice to meet you.

00:18:14.930 --> 00:18:17.110
I'm his little sister, Nagami Suzuka.

00:18:17.400 --> 00:18:19.160
Oh, my, isn't she polite?

00:18:19.160 --> 00:18:21.600
I'm Ahegao Double Peace.

00:18:21.600 --> 00:18:26.030
Still, you're such a brute, Sensei, 
bringing such an innocent little girl

00:18:26.030 --> 00:18:29.140
into this eroge shop just so you 
could get a kick outta her reaction.

00:18:29.140 --> 00:18:30.750
Mad respect!

00:18:30.750 --> 00:18:32.500
I'm not getting any enjoyment out of this!

00:18:33.800 --> 00:18:35.480
If you're gathering material here,

00:18:35.480 --> 00:18:37.860
that means you're struggling 
with the erotic elements, right?

00:18:37.860 --> 00:18:41.630
If that's the case, then 
please let me help you out.

00:18:41.630 --> 00:18:44.310
That's not really how it is.

00:18:44.310 --> 00:18:46.450
We're just gathering material 
on lots of different things

00:18:46.450 --> 00:18:48.890
to make volume two even more entertaining.

00:18:48.890 --> 00:18:50.900
Even more entertaining?

00:18:51.360 --> 00:18:53.880
Way to go, Sensei.

00:18:53.880 --> 00:18:56.900
It's wonderful that 
you're aiming even higher.

00:18:57.100 --> 00:18:59.110
Th-Thank you very much.

00:18:59.390 --> 00:19:03.370
Jeez, Onii-chan, you really do 
like top-heavy women, don't you?

00:19:03.720 --> 00:19:08.520
In that case, please take a look 
at some doujinshi I made for fun.

00:19:08.520 --> 00:19:11.700
It'd really make me happy if 
they helped you with your writing.

00:19:13.480 --> 00:19:15.850
We're bothering the other customers here,

00:19:15.850 --> 00:19:17.020
so let's go elsewhere.

00:19:18.280 --> 00:19:20.780
Here, take a look.

00:19:20.780 --> 00:19:23.530
Thanks. I'll look through the—

00:19:24.300 --> 00:19:27.060
Wh-Wh-Wh-Wh-What <i>is</i> this?!

00:19:27.480 --> 00:19:29.310
Erotic doujinshi!

00:19:29.310 --> 00:19:32.730
N-No, even for erotic doujinshi, this is...

00:19:33.110 --> 00:19:36.190
Well? Isn't it one of the greatest 
pure love stories ever told?

00:19:36.470 --> 00:19:39.190
Which bit of this is <i>pure</i>, exactly?!

00:19:39.620 --> 00:19:42.450
Huh? There aren't any tentacles,

00:19:42.450 --> 00:19:46.620
and the heroine doesn't get raped 
by a hoard of countless faceless men.

00:19:46.620 --> 00:19:49.200
It's a splendid pure love story.

00:19:49.460 --> 00:19:54.130
Double Peace-sensei, your definition 
of "pure love" is somewhat lacking.

00:19:54.990 --> 00:19:56.170
What?!

00:19:56.170 --> 00:19:58.830
M-Me... and Onii-chan...

00:19:58.830 --> 00:20:02.780
...d-d-d-doing... doing such lewd things?!

00:20:02.780 --> 00:20:04.660
Hey, calm down.

00:20:04.660 --> 00:20:07.010
It's just the characters from the book.

00:20:07.010 --> 00:20:10.390
If those two are doing it, it's the same thing!

00:20:10.680 --> 00:20:13.900
I'm so happy your little 
sister's enjoying it, too.

00:20:13.900 --> 00:20:17.400
"Too"? What makes you think <i>I'm</i> enjoying it?!

00:20:19.580 --> 00:20:22.510
But, Sensei, when you were 
looking at those illustrations,

00:20:22.510 --> 00:20:24.100
your eyes went very serious.

00:20:26.960 --> 00:20:31.010
Oh! You should probably 
take it off your little sister soon.

00:20:31.010 --> 00:20:32.370
Why is that?

00:20:32.370 --> 00:20:35.480
Oh, because it gets more 
intense in the second half,

00:20:35.480 --> 00:20:38.130
and it's probably a bit too soon 
for her to see things like that.

00:20:38.420 --> 00:20:41.380
Hey, Suzuka! Turn that tablet off!

00:20:41.970 --> 00:20:44.260
Wh-What ish thish?!

00:20:54.300 --> 00:20:56.060
S-Suzuka! Are you all right?!

00:20:57.520 --> 00:20:59.560
Suzuka! Suzuka!

00:21:06.240 --> 00:21:08.890
O-Over 50 calls?!

00:21:09.330 --> 00:21:11.240
And they're all from Mai...

00:21:12.980 --> 00:21:13.480
Hm?

00:21:13.480 --> 00:21:14.870
Double Peace-sensei?

00:21:15.930 --> 00:21:17.800
Th-That woman...

00:21:19.830 --> 00:21:22.820
Onii-chan, thank you very much.

00:21:23.340 --> 00:21:26.020
I hope I managed to help her out.

00:21:34.630 --> 00:21:36.710
Double Peace-sensei's illustrations...

00:21:36.710 --> 00:21:38.650
Just remembering them makes me blush!

00:21:39.720 --> 00:21:45.150
I-If Onii-chan d-did come seeking 
the k-k-kind of things she drew...

00:21:48.540 --> 00:21:50.410
N-No...

00:21:50.640 --> 00:21:53.330
Th-That's moving way too fast.

00:21:53.870 --> 00:21:57.490
B-But if Onii-chan wants it, then... I'll...

00:21:57.490 --> 00:22:00.100
What am I saying?!

00:22:01.900 --> 00:22:07.630
But lately, Onii-chan's been surrounded 
by beautiful women with big breasts...

00:22:08.280 --> 00:22:11.400
You don't measure a woman's 
value by the size of her breasts!

00:22:11.400 --> 00:22:15.020
I'm going to become number 
one in Onii-chan's eyes!

00:23:45.020 --> 00:24:00.040
Illustration: Ueno Meguru

00:23:45.600 --> 00:23:47.440
Yes, hello! Esaka-san here!

00:23:47.440 --> 00:23:49.830
So, Suzuka-san, tell me about Nagamin today!

00:23:49.830 --> 00:23:50.750
About Onii-chan?

00:23:50.750 --> 00:23:55.880
Onii-chan always helps me when I'm 
in trouble, and he's so cool, and... and...

00:23:54.160 --> 00:24:00.040
Next Episode

00:23:54.160 --> 00:24:00.040
My Little Sister and I are 
Light Novel Authors Together

00:23:55.880 --> 00:23:56.760
This is no good!

00:23:56.760 --> 00:23:58.160
See you next week!

00:23:58.160 --> 00:23:59.780
Also... also...
